# ant-renamer-qt
===
 Ant Renamer Qt: cross-platform batch file renamer in C++20/Qt 6 for Windows and Linux. Regular expressions, EXIF/IPTC/XMP and ID3 metadata, natural sorting, sidecar files, renaming history. Based on Ant Renamer by Antoine Potten, with his agreement.
